Q: C# switch statement limitations - why? A: <p>Microsoft finally heard you!</p>
<p>Now with C# 7 you can:</p>
<pre><code>switch(shape)
{
    case null:
        throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(shape));
    case Circle c:
        WriteLine($&quot;circle with radius {c.Radius}&quot;);
        break;
    case Rectangle s when (s.Length == s.Height):
        WriteLine($&quot;{s.Length} x {s.Height} square&quot;);
        break;
    case Rectangle r:
        WriteLine($&quot;{r.Length} x {r.Height} rectangle&quot;);
        break;
    default:
        WriteLine(&quot;&lt;unknown shape&gt;&quot;);
        break;
}
</code></pre>

Q: How to hide the empty space left behind by the hidden calendar icon when a date input is disabled A: <p>You can override the built-in ui via css and hide the calendar</p>
<p>Separately you can also cap the element's width to cap at content length by doing</p>
<pre><code>.input[type=&quot;date&quot;] {
  width: fit-content;
}
</code></pre>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-css lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>input[type="date"]:disabled::-webkit-calendar-picker-indicator {
    display: none;
}

input[type="date"]:disabled {
    padding-right: 0;
}</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;input type="date" disabled/&gt;</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</p>

Q: How to set a FONT in HTML A: <p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;html&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;body style=&quot;background: #1a1a1a; color: white; text-align: center; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;</p>
<pre><code>\&lt;h1\&gt;Deep Forest Survival - Demo\&lt;/h1\&gt;

\&lt;div id=&quot;game&quot; style=&quot;width: 400px; height: 300px; background: #002200; margin: auto; border: 2px solid #555;&quot;\&gt;

    \&lt;p id=&quot;status&quot;\&gt;Trời đang sáng. Hãy đi thu thập tài nguyên!\&lt;/p\&gt;

    \&lt;button onclick=&quot;collect()&quot;\&gt;Thu thập gỗ\&lt;/button\&gt;

\&lt;/div\&gt;

\&lt;p\&gt;Tài nguyên gỗ: \&lt;span id=&quot;wood&quot;\&gt;0\&lt;/span\&gt;\&lt;/p\&gt;

\&lt;script\&gt;

    let wood = 0;

    function collect() {

        wood++;

        document.getElementById('wood').innerText = wood;

        if(wood \&gt;= 5) document.getElementById('status').innerText = &quot;Đêm đến rồi! Quái vật xuất hiện!&quot;;

    }

\&lt;/script
</code></pre>
<p>\&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;/body&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;/html&gt;</p>
